WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.534 --> 00:00:02.235
Former President

00:00:02.235 --> 00:00:02.736
Donald Trump

00:00:02.736 --> 00:00:04.604
is officially back on the campaign

00:00:04.604 --> 00:00:05.572
trail holding

00:00:05.572 --> 00:00:07.007
what they described in the campaign

00:00:07.007 --> 00:00:08.975
as the first rally of his 20, 24

00:00:08.975 --> 00:00:10.710
presidential campaign

00:00:10.710 --> 00:00:12.045
to return to the White House yesterday

00:00:12.045 --> 00:00:13.113
in Waco, Texas.

00:00:13.113 --> 00:00:14.214
The event featured

00:00:14.214 --> 00:00:15.115
all of Trump's

00:00:15.115 --> 00:00:17.117
familiar lies about the 2020 election.

00:00:17.117 --> 00:00:18.752
He also called for the elimination

00:00:18.752 --> 00:00:20.620
of the deep state.

00:00:20.620 --> 00:00:22.689
But as he is facing legal investigations

00:00:22.689 --> 00:00:23.456
in three different

00:00:23.456 --> 00:00:24.357
jurisdictions, Trump

00:00:24.357 --> 00:00:26.493
complained about what he sees

00:00:26.493 --> 00:00:28.762
is the newest weapon in the Democrat's

00:00:28.762 --> 00:00:30.296
attempts to steal the next election.

00:00:30.296 --> 00:00:31.731
This is how he put it

00:00:33.166 --> 00:00:35.235
prosecutorial misconduct

00:00:35.235 --> 00:00:36.903
is their new tool,

00:00:36.903 --> 00:00:38.838
and they are willing to use it at levels

00:00:38.838 --> 00:00:40.874
never seen before.

00:00:40.874 --> 00:00:41.741
In our country.

00:00:41.741 --> 00:00:42.842
We've had it

00:00:42.842 --> 00:00:45.178
but we've never had it like this.

00:00:45.178 --> 00:00:46.279
We must stop them

00:00:46.279 --> 00:00:48.548
and we must not allow them

00:00:48.548 --> 00:00:50.116
to go through another election

00:00:50.116 --> 00:00:52.318
where they have yet another

00:00:52.318 --> 00:00:53.653
tool in their toolkit.

00:00:55.355 --> 00:00:56.389
And join me now to talk

00:00:56.389 --> 00:00:57.390
about all of this.

00:00:57.390 --> 00:00:59.893
Congresswoman Zoe Lofgren of California.

00:00:59.893 --> 00:01:01.194
She was a member of the January

00:01:01.194 --> 00:01:02.695
six select committee.

00:01:02.695 --> 00:01:03.696
Congresswoman,

00:01:03.696 --> 00:01:05.231
thank you for being with us.

00:01:05.231 --> 00:01:07.434
What do you make of Trump's comments

00:01:07.434 --> 00:01:08.668
about these investigations

00:01:08.668 --> 00:01:09.836
swirling around him?

00:01:09.836 --> 00:01:10.570
He's talking

00:01:10.570 --> 00:01:12.772
about prosecutorial misconduct.

00:01:13.640 --> 00:01:15.208
And we, as we mentioned with Daniel Dale

00:01:15.208 --> 00:01:16.409
are fact-checker in the previous hour.

00:01:16.409 --> 00:01:17.777
He's not offering any evidence of that.

00:01:17.777 --> 00:01:19.879
He's just saying it

00:01:21.247 --> 00:01:22.849
well, there is no evidence.

00:01:22.849 --> 00:01:26.252
And I think obviously he appears

00:01:26.252 --> 00:01:29.322
to be worried that he will be indicted.

00:01:29.722 --> 00:01:31.858
I don't know if will be indicted,

00:01:31.858 --> 00:01:32.959
but certainly

00:01:32.959 --> 00:01:34.861
he engaged in criminal conduct.

00:01:34.861 --> 00:01:36.062
I mean, our committee

00:01:36.062 --> 00:01:38.031
did criminal referrals,

00:01:38.031 --> 00:01:40.733
of course, doing the referral and

00:01:40.733 --> 00:01:42.102
you know, being the prosecutors

00:01:42.102 --> 00:01:43.770
to two different things.

00:01:43.770 --> 00:01:45.872
They have to make sure that not only do

00:01:45.872 --> 00:01:47.807
they have probable cause,

00:01:47.807 --> 00:01:49.676
but I think given

00:01:49.676 --> 00:01:51.044
the high profile

00:01:51.044 --> 00:01:52.612
of a potential defendant,

00:01:52.612 --> 00:01:54.180
they're going to want to ensure

00:01:54.180 --> 00:01:55.482
ensure that they

00:01:55.482 --> 00:01:57.784
have sufficient evidence to convict.

00:01:58.151 --> 00:02:00.620
So there's no evidence whatsoever

00:02:00.620 --> 00:02:01.588
that there's

00:02:01.588 --> 00:02:03.656
anything improper on the part

00:02:04.023 --> 00:02:05.592
of the prosecutors, although

00:02:06.559 --> 00:02:07.994
the ex-president certainly

00:02:07.994 --> 00:02:09.629
tried to weaponize

00:02:09.629 --> 00:02:10.864
the Department of Justice

00:02:10.864 --> 00:02:13.233
when he was president.

00:02:13.266 --> 00:02:15.335
And he called the 20, 24

00:02:15.335 --> 00:02:18.571
campaign the final battle last night.

00:02:18.571 --> 00:02:19.606
He did this in Waco,

00:02:19.606 --> 00:02:21.541
Texas, during the 30th anniversary

00:02:21.541 --> 00:02:22.742
of the infamous standoff

00:02:22.742 --> 00:02:23.710
between federal agents

00:02:23.710 --> 00:02:25.912
and the Branch Davidian cult

00:02:25.912 --> 00:02:26.579
in that area.

00:02:26.579 --> 00:02:28.248
Let's listen to that

00:02:29.549 --> 00:02:31.851
And 2024 is the final battle.

00:02:31.851 --> 00:02:33.153
That's going to be the big one.

00:02:33.153 --> 00:02:35.522
Our enemies are desperate to stop us

00:02:35.522 --> 00:02:36.456
because they know

00:02:36.456 --> 00:02:38.358
that we are the only ones

00:02:38.358 --> 00:02:39.526
who can stop them.

00:02:39.526 --> 00:02:41.828
All of the hatred, rage and contempt

00:02:42.929 --> 00:02:44.397
the radical left has for

00:02:44.397 --> 00:02:45.798
you and your values.

00:02:45.798 --> 00:02:47.100
And this nation

00:02:47.100 --> 00:02:49.202
has been very much directed on me.

00:02:49.502 --> 00:02:52.906
Either the deep state destroys America

00:02:53.106 --> 00:02:56.042
or we destroy the deep state.

00:02:56.075 --> 00:02:57.677
They're not coming after me.

00:02:57.677 --> 00:02:59.012
They're coming after you.

00:02:59.012 --> 00:03:00.647
And I'm just standing in their way.

00:03:02.282 --> 00:03:02.882
It's the

00:03:02.882 --> 00:03:04.350
same language of incitement

00:03:04.350 --> 00:03:05.552
that we've heard time and again

00:03:05.552 --> 00:03:06.719
from the former president.

00:03:06.719 --> 00:03:08.888
We know that Late last week,

00:03:08.888 --> 00:03:10.823
the House Democratic leader Hakeem

00:03:10.823 --> 00:03:12.258
Jeffries, was talking

00:03:12.258 --> 00:03:13.193
about how he was worried

00:03:13.193 --> 00:03:15.662
that somebody could get killed

00:03:15.795 --> 00:03:17.530
with all of this rhetoric flying around.

00:03:17.530 --> 00:03:20.533
Are you worried about that, too?

00:03:21.334 --> 00:03:22.902
Well, I think it's a concern.

00:03:22.902 --> 00:03:24.037
The rhetoric

00:03:24.037 --> 00:03:27.540
that he's using today is not dissimilar

00:03:28.074 --> 00:03:29.475
to the type of rhetoric

00:03:29.475 --> 00:03:31.544
he is prior to January six, in fact.

00:03:31.778 --> 00:03:33.947
In some ways, it's more overt

00:03:33.947 --> 00:03:35.949
and blatant than the

00:03:37.684 --> 00:03:39.652
events leading up to January 6th.

00:03:39.652 --> 00:03:41.588
I mean, he posted

00:03:41.588 --> 00:03:42.956
a picture of himself

00:03:42.956 --> 00:03:45.058
holding a baseball bat

00:03:45.058 --> 00:03:48.361
next to the prosecutor in Manhattan,

00:03:49.395 --> 00:03:51.364
calling the crossing shooter

00:03:51.364 --> 00:03:53.132
a number of horrible names

00:03:53.132 --> 00:03:54.634
like an animal and thug.

00:03:55.702 --> 00:03:56.703
He

00:03:57.437 --> 00:04:00.940
disparaged the idea that

00:04:00.940 --> 00:04:03.243
his followers should remain peaceful.

00:04:04.377 --> 00:04:07.046
You know, this is cause for concern.

00:04:07.213 --> 00:04:09.148
We know that certainly not

00:04:09.148 --> 00:04:10.250
all of his followers

00:04:10.250 --> 00:04:12.986
are inclined to take up arms.

00:04:12.986 --> 00:04:14.787
But there's enough of them

00:04:14.787 --> 00:04:18.491
were willing to do battle in his behalf

00:04:18.825 --> 00:04:21.661
that someone could get killed.

00:04:21.661 --> 00:04:22.996
And people were killed,

00:04:22.996 --> 00:04:25.965
obviously, on January six.

00:04:25.965 --> 00:04:27.867
And he kicked off this rally

00:04:27.867 --> 00:04:28.368
with a version

00:04:28.368 --> 00:04:29.802
of The Star-Spangled Banner.

00:04:29.802 --> 00:04:31.771
Perhaps you've seen this

00:04:31.771 --> 00:04:32.405
in this version

00:04:32.405 --> 00:04:33.806
was sung by a group of inmates

00:04:33.806 --> 00:04:34.741
currently jailed

00:04:34.741 --> 00:04:35.642
for their role

00:04:35.642 --> 00:04:37.944
in the January 6th attack on the Capitol.

00:04:38.244 --> 00:04:39.279
As the song played,

00:04:39.279 --> 00:04:41.281
Trump was standing on the stage

00:04:41.281 --> 00:04:42.282
with his hand over his heart

00:04:42.282 --> 00:04:44.617
and so on, as as images

00:04:44.617 --> 00:04:45.551
from the attack

00:04:45.551 --> 00:04:47.754
on the Capitol played on screen.

00:04:48.421 --> 00:04:49.555
What did you think of that?

00:04:51.691 --> 00:04:53.693
Well, he's elevating the violence.

00:04:53.693 --> 00:04:55.662
We know from our investigation

00:04:55.662 --> 00:04:56.996
that he tried

00:04:56.996 --> 00:04:59.365
various ways to overturn the election

00:04:59.732 --> 00:05:02.235
but he was left only with mob violence.

00:05:02.468 --> 00:05:03.736
By the time January

00:05:03.736 --> 00:05:07.307
six rolled around to elevate people

00:05:07.940 --> 00:05:09.375
who have been either

00:05:09.375 --> 00:05:11.444
convicted or in most cases

00:05:11.444 --> 00:05:13.479
pled guilty to violent assault,

00:05:13.479 --> 00:05:14.914
these were individuals

00:05:14.914 --> 00:05:17.650
who viciously attacked police officers

00:05:17.650 --> 00:05:19.419
in the assault on the Capitol

00:05:19.419 --> 00:05:21.421
That's not patriotism.

00:05:21.421 --> 00:05:22.121
And that he would

00:05:22.121 --> 00:05:24.157
elevate them is admirable,

00:05:24.157 --> 00:05:25.692
I think tells me a lot

00:05:25.692 --> 00:05:27.460
about where the ex-president

00:05:27.460 --> 00:05:29.195
is in terms of

00:05:29.195 --> 00:05:31.431
honoring and encouraging violence.

00:05:31.831 --> 00:05:33.633
I think it's something

00:05:33.633 --> 00:05:34.934
that's cause for concern.

00:05:34.934 --> 00:05:36.102
I am worried,

00:05:36.102 --> 00:05:38.738
frankly, that my Republican colleagues

00:05:39.105 --> 00:05:40.640
I think many of them don't agree,

00:05:40.640 --> 00:05:42.375
but they are not speaking up

00:05:42.375 --> 00:05:44.477
and they need to do that or else.

00:05:44.477 --> 00:05:45.978
Once again, we'll see

00:05:47.180 --> 00:05:48.614
potentially

00:05:48.614 --> 00:05:49.615
violence brought

00:05:49.615 --> 00:05:51.517
into the political arena.

00:05:51.517 --> 00:05:53.252
And that's not American.

00:05:53.252 --> 00:05:54.721
That's the

00:05:54.721 --> 00:05:57.156
absolute opposite of being pro-American.

00:05:57.757 --> 00:05:59.425
And finally, a federal judge

00:05:59.425 --> 00:06:01.527
ruled this week that some Trump

00:06:01.527 --> 00:06:03.162
allies, top Trump allies.

00:06:03.162 --> 00:06:05.064
Names you would recognize

00:06:05.064 --> 00:06:06.366
would be compelled to testify

00:06:06.366 --> 00:06:07.800
before a grand jury

00:06:07.800 --> 00:06:10.536
about the events surrounding January six.

00:06:10.536 --> 00:06:11.704
You served on the House

00:06:11.704 --> 00:06:13.940
January six committee.

00:06:14.340 --> 00:06:16.242
I mean, you tried mightily

00:06:16.242 --> 00:06:17.009
on that committee

00:06:17.009 --> 00:06:18.077
to have some of these people

00:06:18.077 --> 00:06:19.078
people like Mark Meadows

00:06:19.078 --> 00:06:20.813
come and testify.

00:06:20.813 --> 00:06:22.315
You couldn't compel that testimony.

00:06:22.315 --> 00:06:24.650
It sounds like they'll have to cooperate

00:06:24.650 --> 00:06:25.918
with this grand jury.

00:06:25.918 --> 00:06:28.554
What questions need to be asked

00:06:29.255 --> 00:06:30.556
Well, I have a lot of questions.

00:06:30.556 --> 00:06:32.792
I mean, Meadows was involved

00:06:32.792 --> 00:06:34.394
on a day to day basis

00:06:34.394 --> 00:06:35.361
with the president

00:06:35.361 --> 00:06:36.662
on these various schemes.

00:06:36.662 --> 00:06:39.265
I'd like to know frankly, what documents

00:06:39.766 --> 00:06:41.934
Mark was burning in the fireplace.

00:06:41.934 --> 00:06:44.070
That's been reported by several people.

00:06:44.270 --> 00:06:45.471
I'd like to know

00:06:45.471 --> 00:06:47.473
about the conversations they had

00:06:47.473 --> 00:06:49.776
and what the ex-president was doing on

00:06:49.776 --> 00:06:51.611
January six itself.

00:06:51.611 --> 00:06:53.613
I'd like to know the details

00:06:53.613 --> 00:06:55.615
of the meeting on December 21st

00:06:55.615 --> 00:06:57.116
where members of Congress

00:06:57.116 --> 00:06:58.785
came over to plot

00:06:58.785 --> 00:07:01.187
with the President and Mr.

00:07:01.187 --> 00:07:03.322
Meadows to overturn the election.

00:07:03.322 --> 00:07:04.223
But, you know,

00:07:04.223 --> 00:07:06.392
he still has his Fifth Amendment right

00:07:06.893 --> 00:07:08.995
not to testify against himself.

00:07:09.595 --> 00:07:11.030
And I think he certainly does

00:07:11.030 --> 00:07:13.099
have some criminal exposure.

00:07:13.399 --> 00:07:14.167
You know,

00:07:14.500 --> 00:07:16.569
one of the people I'd like to talk to

00:07:17.136 --> 00:07:17.637
was Dan

00:07:17.637 --> 00:07:20.106
Scavino, who again, was there

00:07:20.106 --> 00:07:21.374
the entire time.

00:07:21.374 --> 00:07:22.708
On January six,

00:07:22.708 --> 00:07:24.610
he could tell us what the president

00:07:24.610 --> 00:07:27.079
the ex-president was doing And also,

00:07:27.313 --> 00:07:28.381
he was,

00:07:28.381 --> 00:07:30.950
you know, right by the president's side.

00:07:30.950 --> 00:07:34.787
Every time there was a digital message

00:07:34.787 --> 00:07:36.122
that was sent out

00:07:36.122 --> 00:07:37.490
And I think he could tell us

00:07:37.490 --> 00:07:38.858
a lot about that, too.

00:07:38.858 --> 00:07:40.593
He also, of course, has

00:07:40.593 --> 00:07:42.695
the Fifth Amendment right not to

00:07:42.695 --> 00:07:44.230
testify against himself.

00:07:45.665 --> 00:07:46.065
All right,

00:07:46.065 --> 00:07:48.234
Congresswoman Zoe Lofgren of California,

00:07:48.935 --> 00:07:50.369
thanks very much for your time.

00:07:50.369 --> 00:07:52.638
We appreciate it, as always. Thank you.

